<body id="thebody" style="defaultCaption">
	<div xml:lang="en">
		<p begin="00:00:00.433" end="00:00:02.000">Our friends in Iowa know</p>
		<p begin="00:00:02.000" end="00:00:03.667">lots of words that begin<br />with the letter &quot;r.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:03.667" end="00:00:04.667">(makes &quot;r&quot; sound)</p>
		<p begin="00:00:04.667" end="00:00:06.267">Rabbit.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:06.267" end="00:00:07.800">Radio.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:07.800" end="00:00:09.600">Rattle.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:09.600" end="00:00:10.800">Rope.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:10.800" end="00:00:12.533">Rose.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:12.533" end="00:00:14.133">Restaurant.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:14.133" end="00:00:16.733">Rake.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:16.733" end="00:00:18.000">Ribbon.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:18.000" end="00:00:20.067">Rug.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:20.067" end="00:00:21.867">Rings.</p>
		<p begin="00:00:21.867" end="00:00:22.467">&quot;R.&quot;</p>
		<p begin="00:00:22.467" end="00:00:23.067">(makes &quot;r&quot; sound)</p>
</div>
